### NAV — `/api/nav`

---

#### 6. GET `/api/nav/{schemeCode}`
Get full NAV history for a fund. Backend handles smart caching with 1-hour cooldown.

| Param | Type | In |
|-------|------|----|
| schemeCode | int | path |

**200:**
```json
{
  "schemeCode": 140085,
  "schemeName": "Nippon India ETF Nifty Next 50 Junior BeES",
  "fundHouse": "Nippon India Mutual Fund",
  "latestNavDate": "01-04-2026",
  "wasFetchedFromApi": true,
  "data": [
    { "date": "01-04-2026", "nav": 667.16510 },
    { "date": "31-03-2026", "nav": 650.35830 }
  ]
}
```

**404:** `{ "message": "Fund with scheme code 999999 not found." }`

> `data` is sorted **newest-first**. `wasFetchedFromApi` = true means fresh data was pulled (useful for a freshness indicator).

